# pc-ui

Windows 9x CSS tokens, primitives, optional React wrappers. Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

- CSS-first. Static sites: one file (`src/pc-ui.css`). Bundled apps: npm + CSS import + optional components.
- Keep wrappers presentational. Preserve tokens; theme via CSS variables.
- Tiled panes: `Desktop tiled` + `Workspace` + `Split` + `Window fill` (or the same classes in HTML).
- After editing tokens/primitives, `npm run build`. Commit generated `pc-ui.css`.
- Do not add Tailwind, window managers, or app-specific names to this package.
